{"des":"白雪下的经商之道-接取步骤","script":"s_5_11_0","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不是，你们怎么搞的？整个车队全被劫了，所有的货物都没了！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]很抱歉，货物被劫的事在这霜烬平原也是时有发生。我们也已经尽力挽回了，请体谅我们的难处。[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可这损失也太大了！不行，你们无论如何也得给我一个说法！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]现在只能等前线的消息了，你们的货物应该都在温泉谷。如果他们能带回来就带回来，实在带不回来的话，也只能接受这批货物的损失了。[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可恶……！你们收了我那么多钱，怎么这点货也保不住啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]缪夏，我是看在你父亲的情面才给你友情价的，这价钱已经很低了。要是实在不满意，你可以自己花钱请雇佣兵护送。[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可现在说什么也没用了……那批货物怎么办啊……[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉……能拿回来就拿回来，拿不回来就当这批货损失了，就这么简单！[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]听我一句劝，就算亏了又如何，这点钱对你家来说根本不算什么。而且这也不是你第一次赔钱了。哥们说句实话，就凭你那商业眼光，做一辈子生意也赶不上你老爹。[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什、什么么么么？！你这个混蛋在胡说八道什么？！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉……行行行，我多嘴。反正事情已经说完，我也该去忙自己的事了。[l][cm]","charaName":"护卫队小队长"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可恶……都在胡说些什么嘛……什么叫我做一辈子都比不上老爸……[l]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_14","text":"那个……请问你没事吧？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]啊？没事？当然没事了！我可是传奇美少女商人缪夏，怎么会因为这点小挫折就被打倒呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]传奇商人？你和那个护卫队是因为货物的问题吵架吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是啊，三大车的货物全都没了，结果他就轻飘飘地说\"货物能拿回来就拿，拿不回来就算了\"，这谁受得了啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]既然他说要自己拿……那好！看装扮，几位应该是契约者吧！我出钱，请两位帮我把货物追回来，可以吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]先自我介绍一下吧，我叫缪夏，是大书院货殖系的学生，这几年正在学着自己做生意。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯……我是米托拉，这位是{myName}和艾薇杜尔。原来你也是商人啊，这几年应该赚了不少钱吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个……很遗憾，我目前所有的生意……全在亏本。[l]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_23","text":"啊？一单赚的都没有？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]嗯，全是失败的。我从魔爪湖进了一批净魔过的鱼打算卖到秋日荒野去，结果发现那里的人根本吃不惯，说什么有药水味儿。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]然后我去索利德山卖黑森林的鲜菌花，结果那些花在运输途中就枯了。后来改去巴诺姆村卖肉，才发现大书院缺的是萝卜，根本不缺肉！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……看来你确实经历了一番惨痛的教训啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没……没关系！持之以恒总能成功的，只要还年轻，还有继续成长的机会！[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没错！所以我这次绝不会再失败了。据护卫队说，我的货物现在被芙洛波劫到了温泉谷，护卫队目前驻扎在温泉村。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我想现在应该是奥格在接待他们……我们这就去找他，问问情况吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]去温泉村找奥格是吗？好，我们出发吧。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}